An open-source reference implementation demonstrating **Local-First Data Persistence** and **Optimistic UI Updates** engineered for high-latency, unstable, or low-bandwidth environments.

---

## 📌 Executive Summary

Standard web architectures assume constant broadband connectivity. In low-bandwidth or high-latency settings, traditional REST/GraphQL pipelines cause UI freezes, request timeouts, and data loss.

This repository provides a production-ready architectural pattern that pairs **Client-Side Edge Storage (SQLite/IndexedDB)** with an **Asynchronous PostgreSQL Sync Engine**. It delivers sub-10ms UI responsiveness while guaranteeing zero data loss during network dropouts.

